OL,3,GNEWSAOyez! Town crier passes bell on
OL,4,Aafter 23 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ceremony has taken place to mark the
OL,7,Fretirement of a town crier after 23
OL,8,Fyears of service.
OL,10,FGraham Pfaff, 78, from Royston, who
OL,11,Fstepped down from the role due to
OL,12,Fhealth concerns, passed on the bell to
OL,13,FStella Mills at Priory Memorial Gardens
OL,14,Fin the Hertfordshire town on Saturday.
OL,16,FPfaff said his time in the role did not
OL,17,Fget off to the best of starts after the
OL,18,Ftown council failed to provide him with
OL,19,Fa pair of ceremonial trousers for his
OL,20,Ffirst public event in 2003.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
